{"records": [{"seq": 1, "id": "ea04c6c8f98d4b9a89de430563c9065c", "role": "user", "content": "『星見会のお知らせ』という見出しをローカル下書きにしてください。外部には送らないでください。", "usable": 1, "source_event_id": null, "manifest": "[]", "supersedes": null}, {"seq": 2, "id": "54e7bb371d4540249a202e46cbc9a5e7", "role": "user", "content": "『青空会の案内』という見出しの案内文のローカル下書きです。会場はまだ指定していません。会場を確認してから仕上げてください。外部には送らないでください。", "usable": 1, "source_event_id": null, "manifest": "[]", "supersedes": null}, {"seq": 3, "id": "49fa24e54e00440aa830fb6fd9deb419", "role": "user", "content": "『河原の散策案内』という見出しをローカル下書きにしてください。外部には送らないでください。", "usable": 1, "source_event_id": null, "manifest": "[]", "supersedes": null}, {"seq": 4, "id": "df4f7c0e8d6e4343bc885d50573e2a09", "role": "assistant", "content": "{\"detail\":{\"revision\":1},\"event\":\"goal.queued\",\"goal_id\":\"756757fb0f474f4c9b1033e308b38d84\"}", "usable": 1, "source_event_id": "b9ccd98d08404ebaaa3862dc02d9d45c", "manifest": "[]", "supersedes": null}, {"seq": 5, "id": "e5aee65b82fb4057b61d27bf4ae25814", "role": "assistant", "content": "{\"detail\":{\"attempt_id\":\"e5ae275caa88433d8e755ea3d1b18332\",\"epoch\":1},\"event\":\"attempt.claimed\",\"goal_id\":\"756757fb0f474f4c9b1033e308b38d84\"}", "usable": 1, "source_event_id": "c95a4e37a0d847dfbfd9dea3d937462d", "manifest": "[]", "supersedes": null}, {"seq": 6, "id": "2980333d797146488df5a0e0cfb2663f", "role": "assistant", "content": "{\"detail\":{\"artifact_id\":\"c439bf6862294ff598885793d7300e02\",\"attempt_id\":\"e5ae275caa88433d8e755ea3d1b18332\",\"check_status\":\"pass\",\"receipt_id\":\"0c22058173f74f0f805a3f067a5e8b5a\"},\"event\":\"goal.completed\",\"goal_id\":\"756757fb0f474f4c9b1033e308b38d84\"}", "usable": 1, "source_event_id": "b742cbe8b8934d5eb7d9707af0cbbba8", "manifest": "[]", "supersedes": null}, {"seq": 7, "id": "6aa176066bec4ab1bdb2848c5ece1bcf", "role": "assistant", "content": "{\"detail\":{\"revision\":1},\"event\":\"goal.queued\",\"goal_id\":\"64613818869240ab8522d5098ac60edb\"}", "usable": 1, "source_